      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACK MARVEL (1) was fast into stride from box six to score two back (27.93) then jumped from the same draw last time but got further back when 7th at Geelong (26.29). Rates on top in this line up. DEADLY FORCE (7) won again in another strong performance making it three straight, scoring by half a length (16.86) at Healesville over 300m. Capable of going well again. NANCY DEVERE (2) had the drop on the lead from the rails draw last start but could only manage second, beaten 4 lengths (23.59) at Horsham in a Grade 5 over 410m. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and six minor placings to her credit. Must be included in calculations. RHYTHMIC ENERGY (8) is coming off a speedy 25.41 victory last time. Can measure up again.",
